# Vendored crate sources (src/rust/vendor) are checked in verbatim: cargo
# verifies every file against the checksums shipped with each package, so
# none of the patterns above may filter one out -- test fixtures named
# *.bin, *.out and so on are part of the package.
!src/rust/vendor/**
